 Smart FloodGuard - System Architecture
 5-Layer Architecture

Layer 1: Sensing Layer
- HC-SR04 Ultrasonic Sensor - Distance/water height
- Water Level Sensor - Water presence
- Rain Sensor - Rainfall intensity

Layer 2: Processing Layer
- ESP32 Microcontroller - Main brain

Layer 3: Power Layer (KEY INNOVATION)
- Buzzer + LED + Siren for local alerts

Layer 4: Communication Layer
- WiFi for data to cloud
-LoRa module

 Layer 5: Cloud & Application Layer
- Firebase - Real-time database
- Blynk Cloud - Dashboard
- Real-time Dashboard with Flood Map
- 3-Level Alert System:
  L1 (10cm): Buzzer + App Notification
  L2 (25cm): SMS + Siren + Telegram to 100 residents
  L3 (40cm): NDRF Call + GPS location + Rescue mode
- User Mobile App + Municipal Admin Panel

Data Flow: Sensors → ESP32 → Communication → Cloud → Alerts to Users & Government
